                                "sense_id": "5441f965-540e-33de-9343-cbe22fb8e8a0",
                                "text": "While this stock has been trading at a low P/E multiple lately, I think its fundamentals are sound, and consider it a good buy for long-term investors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc8e8ada-d89a-4b9b-b038-8adf22b4aaae",
                                "sense_id": "5441f965-540e-33de-9343-cbe22fb8e8a0",
                                "text": "Fundamentals can be poor indicators of the future. Financial statements are backward-looking, meaning they tell you how a company did in the past, not necessarily how it will do in the future."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
